{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_017XDaFjiFZRNYqvU8kzrbxg","type":"tool_result","content":"1\t# Implementation: job view: p -> o\n2\t\n3\tid: 02ckl4\n4\tstatus: open\n5\tdeveloper: @developer\n6\tdate: 2026-08-13\n7\t\n8\t<!-- Produced by @developer after implementation. -->\n9\t\n10\t## Summary\n11\t\n12\tChanged the Owner agent's keyboard shortcut in the TUI's job detail view from\n13\t`p` (a mnemonic left over from when the role was still called \"product owner\")\n14\tto `o`, since the role is now plain \"owner\". The binding lives in the single\n15\t`agentMeta` table in `internal/ui/agents.go`, from which both the action-bar\n16\trendering (`renderActionBar`) and the key dispatch (`agentForKey`) derive, so\n17\tone edit propagated everywhere. `o` collides with nothing on the detail view\n18\t(the list view's `o` quick-session key is a separate view state), and the\n19\tchange is covered by updated and new tests. Build and the full test suite pass.\n20\t\n21\t## Changes\n22\t\n23\tTASK-1: Changed `agents.Owner`'s action-bar key from `\"p\"` to `\"o\"` in the\n24\t`agentMeta` table.\n25\t     files: internal/ui/agents.go\n26\t\n27\tTASK-2: Updated the three existing test assertions that expected the owner\n28\tkey `\"p\"`: the `wantByKey` map in `TestAgentForKeyIgnoresStage`, the\n29\t`\"[p] Owner\"` unified-format button in\n30\t`TestRenderActionBarUnifiedFormat`, and the `\"[p]\"` key in\n31\t`TestRenderActionBarTruncatesLabelsAt80ColsKeysStayIntact`.\n32\t     files: internal/ui/agents_test.go\n33\t\n34\tTASK-3: Added `TestAgentForKeyPNoLongerResolves`, mirroring the existing\n35\t`TestAgentForKeyVNoLongerResolves` precedent (Developer's old `\"v\"` key),\n36\tasserting `\"p\"` no longer resolves to any agent.\n37\t     files: internal/ui/agents_test.go\n38\t\n39\tTASK-4: Verified with `go build ./...` and `go test ./...` — both pass,\n40\tincluding the updated/added ui tests.\n41\t\n42\t## Known issues / follow-ups\n43\t\n44\t- **Git worktree registration for this job is missing** (pre-existing,\n45\t  out of scope): the container's `/workspace` is the job's worktree\n46\t  (`/home/leo/code/.manigot-worktrees/manigot/02ckl4_job-view-p-o`), and its\n47\t  `.git` file points at `/home/leo/code/manigot/.git/worktrees/02ckl4_job-view-p-o`,\n48\t  which does not exist — while the main repo's `worktrees/` currently\n49\t  registers `/workspace` against the *different* job\n50\t  `otv2d2_make-6-string-char-more-writable`. As a result, ordinary `git`\n51\t  commands from `/workspace` fail. Commits were made on\n52\t  `feature/02ckl4_job-view-p-o` via an ephemeral gitdir (sharing the main\n53\t  repo through `commondir`) that writes nothing to the shared\n54\t  `.git/worktrees/` registrations. The host-side `mg` tooling should\n55\t  re-register this job's worktree (and resolve the `/workspace` conflict\n56\t  with the `otv2d2` job) before `mg done` / `mg delete` are run on this job.\n57\t- Nothing else was found to be in scope but undone: the list view's `o`\n58\t  quick-session binding is intentionally unchanged (different view state),\n59\t  and the stale \"b switch branch\" mention in `agents.go`'s comment is a\n60\t  pre-existing, unrelated comment issue.\n61\t"}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"24c1a82b-aecc-49e0-8a6c-9a9931b7cfe5","uuid":"353df04e-290e-40e6-acfd-6bcc33cc09dd","timestamp":"2026-08-28T17:51:38.992Z","tool_use_result":{"type":"text","file":{"filePath":"/workspace/docs/jobs/archive/02ckl4_job-view-p-o/implementation.md","content":"# Implementation: job view: p -> o\n\nid: 02ckl4\nstatus: open\ndeveloper: @developer\ndate: 2026-08-13\n\n<!-- Produced by @developer after implementation. -->\n\n## Summary\n\nChanged the Owner agent's keyboard shortcut in the TUI's job detail view from\n`p` (a mnemonic left over from when the role was still called \"product owner\")\nto `o`, since the role is now plain \"owner\". The binding lives in the single\n`agentMeta` table in `internal/ui/agents.go`, from which both the action-bar\nrendering (`renderActionBar`) and the key dispatch (`agentForKey`) derive, so\none edit propagated everywhere. `o` collides with nothing on the detail view\n(the list view's `o` quick-session key is a separate view state), and the\nchange is covered by updated and new tests. Build and the full test suite pass.\n\n## Changes\n\nTASK-1: Changed `agents.Owner`'s action-bar key from `\"p\"` to `\"o\"` in the\n`agentMeta` table.\n     files: internal/ui/agents.go\n\nTASK-2: Updated the three existing test assertions that expected the owner\nkey `\"p\"`: the `wantByKey` map in `TestAgentForKeyIgnoresStage`, the\n`\"[p] Owner\"` unified-format button in\n`TestRenderActionBarUnifiedFormat`, and the `\"[p]\"` key in\n`TestRenderActionBarTruncatesLabelsAt80ColsKeysStayIntact`.\n     files: internal/ui/agents_test.go\n\nTASK-3: Added `TestAgentForKeyPNoLongerResolves`, mirroring the existing\n`TestAgentForKeyVNoLongerResolves` precedent (Developer's old `\"v\"` key),\nasserting `\"p\"` no longer resolves to any agent.\n     files: internal/ui/agents_test.go\n\nTASK-4: Verified with `go build ./...` and `go test ./...` — both pass,\nincluding the updated/added ui tests.\n\n## Known issues / follow-ups\n\n- **Git worktree registration for this job is missing** (pre-existing,\n  out of scope): the container's `/workspace` is the job's worktree\n  (`/home/leo/code/.manigot-worktrees/manigot/02ckl4_job-view-p-o`), and its\n  `.git` file points at `/home/leo/code/manigot/.git/worktrees/02ckl4_job-view-p-o`,\n  which does not exist — while the main repo's `worktrees/` currently\n  registers `/workspace` against the *different* job\n  `otv2d2_make-6-string-char-more-writable`. As a result, ordinary `git`\n  commands from `/workspace` fail. Commits were made on\n  `feature/02ckl4_job-view-p-o` via an ephemeral gitdir (sharing the main\n  repo through `commondir`) that writes nothing to the shared\n  `.git/worktrees/` registrations. The host-side `mg` tooling should\n  re-register this job's worktree (and resolve the `/workspace` conflict\n  with the `otv2d2` job) before `mg done` / `mg delete` are run on this job.\n- Nothing else was found to be in scope but undone: the list view's `o`\n  quick-session binding is intentionally unchanged (different view state),\n  and the stale \"b switch branch\" mention in `agents.go`'s comment is a\n  pre-existing, unrelated comment issue.\n","numLines":61,"startLine":1,"totalLines":61}}}
